text=Unlock the SILVER prize tier at 25% enrage. This will significantly increase your chance at receiving high value items.<br>Unlock the GOLD prize tier at 100% enrage. This will significantly increase your chance at receiving Telos-related item pieces.<br><br>Killing Telos multiple times in a row will increase your streak count. This increases the quantity of drops you receive and your chance at receiving Telos-related item pieces.<br><br>As the enrage of Telos increases, its health and damage will increase, but so will your chance at receiving high value and Telos-related item pieces.
